WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.455
[MUSIC PLAYING]
[音乐播放中]

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:19.200
BRIAN YU: Welcome back, everyone, to an introduction
布莱恩·余：欢迎大家回来，继续学习

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.520
to programming with Scratch.
用Scratch编程入门课程。

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.030
And last time, we took a look at values, pieces of information
上节课，我们了解了数值，也就是信息片段

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.460
that are stored inside of our Scratch programs
它们存储在我们的Scratch程序里

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.190
that we could use inside of those programs.
我们可以在这些程序中使用它们。

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.950
Today we'll take that idea one step further and take a look
今天，我们要把这个概念再推进一小步，来看看

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:35.280
at how we can use information inside of our Scratch programs
我们如何在Scratch程序中利用信息

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.360
to make decisions by asking questions, and then deciding what to do
通过提出问题来做决策，然后决定该怎么做

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.000
based on the answer to those questions.
根据这些问题的答案来行动。

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.300
And people do this type of thing all the time, asking a question
人们一直都在做这类事情，提出一个问题

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.560
and then making a decision.
然后做出决策。

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.977
When you're deciding when you're trying to leave the home,
当你决定什么时候出门时，

00:00:48.977 --> 00:00:51.270
you might look outside and ask, is it cold outside?
你可能会看看窗外，问问自己，外面冷吗？

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.353
And if it's cold outside, you might wear a jacket.
如果外面冷，你可能会穿件夹克。

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:55.090
Or you might ask, is it raining today?
或者你可能会问，今天下雨吗？

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:56.923
And if it's raining, well, then you're going
如果下雨，那么你就会

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:59.710
to take the action of bringing an umbrella with you, for example.
采取行动，比如带上一把伞。

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:03.170
And you can think of this type of logic as having two parts.
你可以把这种逻辑看作由两部分组成。

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.800
There's a question that you're asking.
有一个你要问的问题。

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:05.850
Is it raining outside?
外面在下雨吗？

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:07.020
Is it cold outside?
外面冷吗？

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.450
And then there's the logic, the decision that you make
然后还有逻辑，也就是你做出的决策

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:11.830
based on the answer to that question.
基于那个问题的答案。

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.320
And computers do the same thing.
计算机也做同样的事情。

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:16.710
Computers ask questions like, is the computer low on battery?
计算机也会问问题，比如，计算机电量低吗？

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:18.480
Is the computer connected to the internet?
计算机连上网了吗？

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.920
And based on the answers to those questions,
然后根据这些问题的答案，

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.380
the computer makes a decision.
计算机做出决策。

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:25.950
And today we'll try to do exactly that sort of thing inside of our Scratch
今天，我们也要在Scratch程序里

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:28.290
programs as well-- asking a question and then
做同样的事情——提出一个问题，然后

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:32.200
making a decision based on the answer to that question.
根据那个问题的答案做出决策。

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:35.760
So let's go ahead and open up Scratch, and we see the familiar Scratch cat
那么，我们现在就打开Scratch，我们看到了熟悉的Scratch猫

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:36.690
here.
在这儿。

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:41.490
And let's make something happen whenever the Space key is pressed.
让我们设定每当按下空格键时就发生点什么。

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:42.580
That's one of our events.
这是我们的一个事件。

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:47.640
So I'll drag that when Space key press event out into my code editor.
所以我要把“当按下空格键”这个事件积木拖到我的代码编辑器里。

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.940
And when the Space is pressed, let's play a sound.
当按下空格键时，让我们播放一个声音。

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.330
And we'll play the meow sound.
我们来播放猫叫的声音。

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.080
So now, every time I press the Space key--
所以现在，每当我按下空格键——

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.540
[MEOWING]
[猫叫声]

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:59.790
You'll hear the cat meow.
你会听到猫叫。

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:02.350
But now, to make this a little bit more interesting,
但现在，为了让它更有趣一点，

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:06.120
let's introduce a new block-- which you can find under the Control section
我们来引入一个新的积木——你可以在积木的“控制”板块里找到它

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:07.380
of the blocks--
的积木——

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:10.169
and that's this if block.
就是这个“如果”积木。

00:02:10.169 --> 00:02:12.300
And what you'll notice in this if block is
在这个“如果”积木里你会注意到

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:16.330
that there are two places where we can add additional blocks into this if
有两个地方可以往这个“如果”

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:16.980
block.
积木里添加额外的积木。

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:22.680
You'll notice that next to the word if is a little hexagonal shaped region
你会注意到“如果”这个词旁边有一个小六边形区域

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.502
where I could drop a block in there.
我可以把一个积木放到那里。

00:02:24.502 --> 00:02:25.960
And we'll do that in just a moment.
我们马上就这么做。

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:29.490
And this hexagon is going to represent the question that we're asking.
这个六边形将代表我们要问的问题。

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:32.640
We're going to ask a question inside of our Scratch program.
我们要在Scratch程序里问一个问题。

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:34.140
It's going to be a yes/no question.
这将是一个是非问题。

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.630
Is the answer to the question yes or no?
这个问题的答案是“是”还是“否”？

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:40.410
Or equivalently, is this question true or false?
或者等价地说，这个问题是“真”还是“假”？

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:42.390
And based on the answer to that question,
根据那个问题的答案，

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.880
we might run some additional blocks that are
我们可能会运行一些额外的积木，这些积木

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:48.630
contained inside of this if block here.
包含在这个“如果”积木里面。

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.820
You see this block has a top and a bottom,
你看这个积木有顶部和底部，

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:54.510
and what that's going to allow us to do is enclose other blocks
这将允许我们把其他积木

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:58.190
inside of this if block right here.
放在这个“如果”积木里面。

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.940
So let's take a look at an example of that
所以让我们来看一个例子

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:04.350
and see how we can fill in those two different parts of the if block.
看看我们如何填充“如果”积木的那两个不同部分。

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.080
The first thing we need is a question, and for that, we
我们首先需要一个问题，为此，我们

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.230
can go down into the Sensing section of blocks.
可以到积木的“感知”板块里去找。

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:14.350
And you'll notice there are a couple of blocks that have this hexagon shape.
你会注意到有几个积木是六边形的。

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:16.050
These are questions that we can ask.
这些是我们可以问的问题。

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:20.040
In computer science, we often call these questions Boolean expressions.
在计算机科学里，我们经常把这些问题叫做布尔表达式。

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:24.180
A Boolean expression is a fancy way of saying anything that is either true--
布尔表达式是一种很专业的说法，意思是任何要么为“真”——

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.690
meaning yes-- or false, meaning no.
也就是“是”——要么为“假”，也就是“否”的东西。

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.660
And the very first one here in the Sensing category
“感知”类别里的第一个

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:34.650
is a Boolean expression called touching mouse pointer.
是一个叫做“碰到鼠标指针”的布尔表达式。

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.258
So I'll go ahead and drag that into the hexagon here, in the if statement.
所以我要把它拖到“如果”语句里的这个六边形区域。

00:03:38.258 --> 00:03:40.050
And you'll notice that it snaps into place.
你会注意到它会自动对齐位置。

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:42.510
It fits right inside of that if statement,
它正好能放进那个“如果”语句里，

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:45.760
which grows to fit the size of the hexagon block.
“如果”语句会变大以适应六边形积木的大小。

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:49.240
And then I'll take the play sound meow until done block,
然后我要拿“播放声音 喵 直到播放完”积木，

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:54.850
and drag it inside of the if statement, and connect all of that
把它拖到“如果”语句里面，然后把它们都连接起来

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:58.300
to the event when the Space key is pressed.
对应“当空格键被按下”这个事件。

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.920
So now the logic is this.
所以现在逻辑是这样的。

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:03.760
When I press the space key, the if block is going to ask that question.
当我按下空格键时，“如果”积木就会提出那个问题。

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:07.880
Is the cat touching the mouse pointer, the cursor on the screen?
猫是否碰到了鼠标指针，也就是屏幕上的光标？

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.360
And if the answer is yes, then we're going
如果答案是肯定的，那么我们就要

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.040
to play the sound meow until done.
播放“喵”的声音直到结束。

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:16.779
But that's only going to happen if this condition is true, if we are actually
但这只有在这个条件为真时才会发生，也就是我们实际上

00:04:16.779 --> 00:04:18.430
touching the mouse pointer.
碰到了鼠标指针。

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.339
So if I put my mouse pointer somewhere other than the cat
所以如果我把鼠标指针放在猫以外的地方

00:04:21.339 --> 00:04:26.620
and I press the Spacebar, you'll notice that I don't hear anything.
然后按下空格键，你会注意到我什么声音都听不到。

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.880
But if I move my cursor over the cat and now press the Spacebar--
但如果我把光标移到猫上面，然后按下空格键——

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:32.772
[MEOWING]
[猫叫声]

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:39.320
Now, every time I press the Spacebar, you do, in fact, hear the cat meow.
现在，每次我按下空格键，实际上你都会听到猫叫。

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.730
So our programs using these conditions now have the ability to make decisions,
所以我们使用这些条件的程序现在有了做决策的能力，

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:47.730
to ask a question and then make a decision based on the answer.
提出一个问题，然后根据答案做出决策。

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.090
And this touching mouse pointer block can
这个“碰到鼠标指针”积木可以

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:53.240
be used to check if the sprite is touching the mouse pointer,
用来检查角色是否碰到了鼠标指针，

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:56.120
but also if it's touching another sprite, for example.
例如，也可以检查它是否碰到了另一个角色。

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.820
Let's say the cat is playing with a balloon.
假设猫正在和一个气球玩耍。

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:00.410
I can drag a balloon out.
我可以拖出一个气球。

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:02.360
So we've got the cat and the balloon.
所以我们有了猫和气球。

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:07.460
And I'll say, for the cat, now, if you're touching the balloon,
我要说，对于猫而言，现在，如果你碰到了气球，

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.170
then play the meow sound.
那么就播放“喵”的声音。

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:14.505
So right now I press the Spacebar, and nothing happens,
所以现在我按下空格键，什么都没发生，

00:05:14.505 --> 00:05:16.880
but if I move the cat so that it's touching the balloon--
但如果我移动猫，让它碰到气球——

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.680
[MEOWING]
[猫叫声]

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:23.230
Well, now we're able to detect that.
嗯，现在我们能够检测到了。

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:26.090
We're able to sense that the cat is touching the balloon,
我们能够感知到猫碰到了气球，

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.350
and because of that we're able to make some decisions.
正因为如此，我们能够做出一些决策。

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.630
And these sensing blocks give you the ability
这些感知类积木赋予你能力

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:35.440
to allow your sprites to sense the things around it, figure out how close
让你的角色感知周围的事物，弄清楚其他角色[听不清]或光标离它

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.960
or how far away are other rights [INAUDIBLE] the cursor,
有多近或多远，

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:41.290
figure out what it's touching, whether it's touching a particular sprite
弄清楚它碰到了什么，是碰到了某个特定的角色

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.020
or even touching a particular color.
还是甚至碰到了某种特定的颜色。

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:47.680
This block here lets you check if the sprite is touching something
这里这个积木可以让你检查角色是否碰到了

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.050
that is a particular color, and you can use
某种特定颜色的东西，而且你也可以用

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:54.178
that to build some interesting interfaces as well.
它来构建一些有趣的界面。

00:05:54.178 --> 00:05:55.220
So let's give that a try.
所以让我们试试看。

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:59.440
I'll get rid of the balloon for now, and let's add a backdrop
我现在先把气球去掉，然后给我们的猫添加一个背景

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.150
for our cat to play around in.
让它在里面玩耍。

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:05.060
And I want to try the winter backdrop here.
我想在这里试试冬季背景。

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.580
So you've got a winter backdrop.
这样你就有了一个冬季背景。

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.710
And now the code I'm going to write is this.
现在我要编写的代码是这样的。

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.900
We're no longer going to respond to the Space key,
我们不再对空格键做出响应，

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:14.360
so I'll delete that by dragging it off.
所以我会把它拖走删除。

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:18.110
But now, when the right arrow key is pressed,
但是现在，当按下右箭头键时，

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.000
I'd like the cat to move to the right.
我希望这只猫向右移动。

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.500
This is something we've seen before.
这是我们之前见过的内容。

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.470
Moving is controlled by a motion block, and we
移动是由一个运动积木控制的，而且我们

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:27.290
are going to change the x value by 10.
要把x值增加10。

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:30.050
Remember, the x is, how far to the left or to the right
记住，x值表示这个特定角色在左右方向上的位置，

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:32.030
is this particular sprite?
也就是这个角色离左边或右边有多远？

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:35.600
So when the right arrow's pressed, we're going to change the x value by 10,
所以当按下右箭头键时，我们要把x值增加10，

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:39.200
but now what I'd like to do is get the cat to detect somehow
但现在我想做的是让这只猫以某种方式检测到

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:41.070
when it's touching one of the trees.
它什么时候碰到了其中一棵树。

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:42.470
There's a tree off to the right.
右边有一棵树。

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.762
There's a tree off to the left.
左边也有一棵树。

00:06:43.762 --> 00:06:46.850
If the cat is ever touching a tree, I'd like the cat to know,
如果这只猫碰到了一棵树，我希望它能知道，

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:48.360
so we can report as much.
这样我们就能进行相应报告。

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:51.200
It can say that it found a tree, for instance.
比如它可以说它找到了一棵树。

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.728
How could we do that?
我们要怎么做呢？

00:06:52.728 --> 00:06:54.020
Well, the tree is not a sprite.
嗯，树不是一个角色。

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:57.120
It's not one of these sprites that I see down below.
它不是我在下面看到的这些角色之一。

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.520
It's just part of the backdrop.
它只是背景的一部分。

00:06:58.520 --> 00:06:59.850
It's just there.
它就在那里。

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.360
And so if I want to detect it, I can detect it
所以如果我想检测到它，我可以通过

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.790
by looking for a particular color.
寻找特定的颜色来检测。

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:08.100
So I might say, if--
所以我可以说，如果——

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.960
and then going to Sensing--
然后进入侦测模块——

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.290
touching color.
碰到颜色。

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:15.070
And if I click on this little color well here in this oval,
如果我点击这个椭圆里的这个小颜色框，

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:18.960
I can control what color I'd like to check to see if I'm touching.
我就能控制我想要检查是否碰到的颜色。

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:22.210
And I could try to come up with a green that looks like the green of the tree,
我可以试着找出一种看起来和树的绿色一样的绿色，

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.550
but it'll be difficult for me to get it exactly.
但要让颜色完全一致对我来说会很困难。

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:27.580
And for that reason, there's a great tool down below.
出于这个原因，下面有一个很棒的工具。

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.880
If I click on this eyedropper button, that
如果我点击这个滴管按钮，它

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.800
lets me pick a color from the stage.
能让我从舞台上选取一种颜色。

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.590
You'll notice I can drag my cursor over the stage.
你会注意到我可以在舞台上拖动光标。

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.660
It's picking out individual colors.
它正在挑选出单个的颜色。

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:41.710
And I can say, I want you to detect this color right here, this green
我可以说，我希望你检测这里的这种颜色，这种绿色

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.880
that my cursor's hovering over now.
我鼠标指针现在正悬停在上面的那个。

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.950
And you'll notice that, when I click there,
你会注意到，当我点击那里时，

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:48.040
now the colors automatically update.
现在颜色会自动更新。

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:51.070
Now my cat is going to be checking if it's ever touching
现在我的猫要去检查它是否碰到了

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:54.050
that green that makes up those trees.
构成那些树的绿色。

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:56.440
And if it is touching the green that makes up the trees,
如果它碰到了构成树的绿色，

00:07:56.440 --> 00:08:00.490
well, then let's go ahead and have the cat say something.
那么，就让猫说点什么吧。

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:05.300
And the cat's going to say, I found a tree.
猫会说：“我找到一棵树了。”

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:09.970
So now the cat can move to the right every time I press the right key.
所以现在每次我按右方向键，猫就能向右移动。

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:10.900
And it just moves.
它就这么移动着。

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.012
That's all it's doing.
它就只做这件事。

00:08:12.012 --> 00:08:12.970
But it's also checking.
但它也在检查。

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:16.802
It's asking that question, is the cat touching the green?
它在问这个问题：猫碰到绿色了吗？

00:08:16.802 --> 00:08:19.510
And it's not touching the green, so nothing's happening just yet.
它没碰到绿色，所以目前什么都没发生。

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:23.110
Every time I press the arrow key, we're just changing the x value.
每次我按方向键，我们只是在改变x值。

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:24.130
But watch what happens.
但看看会发生什么。

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:28.030
Eventually-- and it'll probably happen right there--
最终——可能就在那里会发生——

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:33.530
the cat touches the green in the tree, and the cat says, I found a tree.
猫碰到了树上的绿色，然后猫说：“我找到一棵树了。”

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.652
So these sensing blocks allow us to let our sprites
所以这些感知积木让我们的角色

00:08:36.652 --> 00:08:38.860
be a little more intelligent about what's around it--
能对周围的情况更“聪明”一些——

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:42.020
what's in the backdrop, what colors does it happen to be touching,
背景里有什么，它碰巧碰到了什么颜色，

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.360
and what spritz does it happen to be touching.
它碰巧碰到了什么角色。

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:49.190
And we can use that to create some interesting programs as well.
我们也可以用这些来创建一些有趣的程序。

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:52.243
But let's now revisit one of the programs that we already made
但现在让我们回头看看我们已经做过的一个程序，

00:08:52.243 --> 00:08:54.160
and see if we can make it a little better now.
看看我们现在能不能把它改进一下。

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:57.040
I'll go ahead and delete the cat and change the backdrop.
我先把猫删掉，然后换个背景。

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:00.970
We'll go back to just the plain white backdrop.
我们换回纯白色的背景。

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.520
And let's bring back the balloon.
让我们把气球再弄回来。

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.280
You might remember from when we were working with the balloon
你可能还记得我们之前摆弄气球的时候，

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:09.160
a little bit earlier that we were making the balloon bigger.
我们让气球变大了。

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.368
Every time we blew, for example, into the microphone,
比如，每次我们对着麦克风吹气，

00:09:11.368 --> 00:09:13.577
the balloon was getting bigger and bigger and bigger.
气球就变得越来越大。

00:09:13.577 --> 00:09:15.830
In reality, you can't make a balloon bigger forever.
实际上，你不可能让气球一直变大。

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:18.910
Eventually, that balloon is going to pop, and so let's
最终，气球会爆掉，所以让我们

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.620
get this balloon to eventually pop.
让这个气球最终爆掉吧。

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:24.280
I'll go ahead and center the balloon by changing the x and the y
我先通过把x值和y值

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.450
values both to 0.
都改成0来让气球居中。

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:30.920
And now I'll have the balloon respond to me pressing the Space key.
现在我要让气球对我按空格键做出反应。

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:34.340
The Space key is how I'm going to inflate this balloon.
我要用空格键来给这个气球充气。

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:43.020
And when the Space is pressed, I would like to change the size by 10.
当按下空格键时，我想把大小改变10。

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:46.110
This is similar to what we had before where, whenever something happens--
这和我们之前的情况类似，也就是每当有事情发生时——

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:48.623
in this case, I'm pressing the Space key-- the balloon just
在这个例子里，我按下空格键——气球就会

00:09:48.623 --> 00:09:50.040
gets bigger and bigger and bigger.
变得越来越大。

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:52.590
And you can see the size down below grow.
你可以看到下面显示的大小数值在增长。

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:53.860
It's 170 now.
现在是170。

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.880
Now it's 180.
现在是180。

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:55.780
Now it's 190.
现在是190。

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.720
Now it's 200, for example.
比如，现在是200了。

00:09:57.720 --> 00:10:00.180
And this maybe feels big enough.
这也许感觉足够大了。

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:05.510
Once it gets to size 200, then I want to have the balloon pop, for example.
比如，一旦气球大小达到200，我就想让气球爆炸。

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:10.050
So let's bring the size back to 100, back to the original size.
所以让我们把大小调回到100，也就是最初的大小。

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.820
I can ask a question.
我可以提个问题。

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:15.312
I can go to Control and bring out an if statement.
我可以到“控制”里，拖出一个“如果”语句。

00:10:15.312 --> 00:10:18.270
And this time, the question I want to ask is not whether the balloon is
这次，我想问的问题不是气球是否

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:22.320
touching something-- it's whether the size is 100--
碰到了什么东西——而是大小是否为100——

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:23.040
or 200.
或者是200。

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:27.120
And how could I check to see if the size is 200?
我要怎么检查大小是否为200呢？

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:30.730
Well, down here in Operators-- we've seen a couple of operators before.
嗯，在“运算”这里——我们之前见过几个运算符了。

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.930
We've seen the operators to do math, like addition, multiplication,
我们见过用于数学运算的运算符，比如加法、乘法，

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:35.340
subtraction, and division.
减法和除法。

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.740
We've seen the operator that picks a random number.
我们见过选取随机数的运算符。

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.530
And these were all oval-shaped operators.
这些都是椭圆形的运算符。

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:44.650
But now let's take a look at some of these hexagon-shaped operators.
但现在让我们看看这些六边形的运算符。

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:48.090
These hexagon-shaped operators are all Boolean expressions,
这些六边形的运算符都是布尔表达式，

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:52.830
things that can be either true or false, answered yes or no.
也就是结果要么为真要么为假，可以用是或否来回答的东西。

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:58.800
And one of them here is whether something is equal to something else.
这里面有一个是判断某个东西是否等于另一个东西。

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:02.650
So if I have two values and I want to know, are they equal to each other,
所以如果我有两个值，并且想知道它们是否相等，

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:06.300
I can use this check here-- this hexagon-shaped block--
我可以用这里这个检查——这个六边形的积木——

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:09.503
to check to see if those two values are equal to each other.
来检查这两个值是否相等。

00:11:09.503 --> 00:11:10.920
And that's what I want to do here.
这就是我在这里要做的。

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:13.770
I want to take my sprite, the balloon, and check
我想选中我的角色，也就是气球，然后检查

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:17.640
to see if the size is equal to 200.
大小是否等于200。

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:21.210
So I'll take this block, drag it into the hexagon area
所以我要把这个积木拖到

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.220
next to the if statement.
“如果”语句旁边的六边形区域。

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:29.340
And let me grab the size value, which is under the Looks category.
让我来获取大小值，它在“外观”类别下面。

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:36.790
Here's my size value, and I want to check if the size is equal to 200.
这就是我的大小值，我想检查大小是否等于200。

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.730
And if the size is equal to 200, what do I want to do?
如果大小等于200，我想做什么呢？

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:42.630
Well, the first thing I'll have this program do is hide.
嗯，我要让这个程序做的第一件事是隐藏。

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.550
The balloon's going to hide.
气球要隐藏起来。

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.710
And then, just for fun, let's go into sound
然后，只是为了好玩，让我们来看看声音方面

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:51.092
and have the balloon play the sound pop until it's done.
并让气球播放“砰”的声音，直到播放完毕。

00:11:51.092 --> 00:11:52.800
So now, what is the logic of the program?
那么现在，这个程序的逻辑是什么呢？

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:56.610
Well, every time I press the Space key, we're going to run this line--
嗯，每次我按下空格键，我们就会运行这一行——

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.260
change the size by 10.
将大小改变 10。

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:00.450
But we're also going to ask that question--
但我们也要问那个问题——

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:02.970
check if the size is equal to 200.
检查大小是否等于 200。

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:06.990
And only if the answer to that question is yes, then we hide the balloon,
只有当那个问题的答案是“是”时，我们才隐藏气球，

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.240
and then we play the sound pop until it's done.
然后让气球播放“砰”的声音，直到播放完毕。

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:13.020
So let's give the program a try and see what happens
所以让我们来试试这个程序，看看会发生什么

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.270
once I start to inflate this balloon.
一旦我开始给这个气球充气。

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:16.980
It's at size 100 right now.
它现在的大小是 100。

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:21.240
And remember, you can check that just by looking down below here at the size.
记住，你可以通过看下面这里的大小来确认。

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.950
And let's press the Space.
让我们按下空格键。

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:23.880
It inflates a little.
它稍微膨胀了一点。

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:28.740
Its size is 110, 120, 130, 140, 150.
它的大小变成了 110、120、130、140、150。

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:31.110
And now it's at 190, and watch what happens
现在它到了 190，看看接下来会发生什么

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.720
the next time I try and inflate the balloon one more time,
下次我再试着给气球充一次气的时候，

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:37.400
as by pressing the Space key.
也就是按下空格键的时候。

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.740
It goes ahead and it hides.
它就会直接隐藏起来。

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.640
And I could try that again.
我可以再试一次。

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:44.920
We'll go ahead and show the balloon again,
我们接着再把气球显示出来，

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:47.840
and I can do that by using this Show block here.
我可以通过使用这里的“显示”积木来做到。

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:50.560
I'll just click on Show, and it will show the balloon.
我只要点击“显示”，它就会显示气球。

00:12:50.560 --> 00:13:00.600
And the balloon inflates, and then it disappears with a pop.
气球膨胀，然后“砰”的一声消失了。

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.540
So that's how we can use conditions to check
所以这就是我们如何使用条件来检查

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.430
if two things are equal to each other.
两个东西是否彼此相等。

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.557
But you probably noticed down in Operators
但你可能注意到在“运算符”里

00:13:06.557 --> 00:13:08.390
that we don't just have the ability to check
我们不只是有能力检查

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.200
if two things are equal to each other.
两个东西是否彼此相等。

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:14.270
We can check if one number is less than another number or greater than another
例如，我们可以检查一个数字是否小于另一个数字或者大于另一个

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.660
number, for example.
数字。

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:18.080
And let's give that a try.
让我们来试试这个。

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.810
Instead of using the balloon, I'll bring out another sprite.
我不用气球了，换一个角色。

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:27.380
Let's choose the duck this time.
这次我们选鸭子吧。

00:13:27.380 --> 00:13:32.060
I'll center the duck by moving it to 0 for x and 0 for y.
我把鸭子移到 x 坐标为 0、y 坐标为 0 的位置，让它居中。

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:35.810
And when I press the green flag to start this program,
当我按下绿色旗帜来启动这个程序时，

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.030
the duck is going to ask a question.
鸭子会问一个问题。

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:42.040
And the question might be, type a number.
问题可能是：输入一个数字。

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:44.120
So it's asking me to type in a number.
所以它在让我输入一个数字。

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:47.440
So now, when I press the green flag, the duck asks me to type in a number,
所以现在，当我按下绿色旗帜时，鸭子让我输入一个数字，

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:48.820
and I could type in a number.
我可以输入一个数字。

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:52.750
I could type in the number 1, for example, and press Return.
比如，我可以输入数字1，然后按回车键。

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:57.193
So the duck now has a number, and now we could ask questions about that number.
现在这只鸭子有了一个数字，我们就可以针对这个数字提问了。

00:13:57.193 --> 00:13:59.110
So if I want to check to see if that number is
所以，如果我想查看那个数字是否

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:03.220
positive or negative, for example, I could add a condition.
为正数或负数，比如，我可以添加一个条件。

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:10.430
I could say, if, and then take the greater than block out--
我可以说“如果”，然后把“大于”积木拖出来——

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.230
which is under Operators.
它在“运算”分类下。

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:14.900
And now I want to say, if the answer--
现在我想说，如果答案——

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:19.190
which is in the Sensing category-- if the answer is greater than 0,
它在“侦测”分类里——如果答案大于0，

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:22.800
well, then whatever number the user typed in-- that's a positive number.
那么，不管用户输入的是什么数字——那就是一个正数。

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:25.640
And so we'll go into the Looks section, and let's go ahead
所以我们进入“外观”板块，然后我们接着

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:30.312
and say positive for two seconds.
说“正数”两秒钟。

00:14:30.312 --> 00:14:33.520
So we ask the user for a number, and if the user types in a positive number--
我们让用户输入一个数字，如果用户输入的是一个正数——

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.740
something like the number 2--
比如数字2——

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:37.260
well, the duck says positive--
那么这只鸭子会说“正数”——

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:37.760
great.
很好。

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:42.070
And instead, if we typed in a negative number-- let's say negative 2--
相反，如果我们输入一个负数——比如负2——

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:43.990
the duck doesn't say anything at all.
这只鸭子什么都不会说。

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:46.790
So we're able to check to see if their answer is positive,
所以我们能够查看他们的答案是否为正数，

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:50.290
and if what the user typed in was positive-- if that's true, then
如果用户输入的是正数——如果这是真的，那么

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.780
we're going to say positive for two seconds.
我们会说“正数”两秒钟。

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:56.500
But oftentimes, we want to be able to make a decision based
但很多时候，我们希望能够根据

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.490
on either answer to the question.
问题的两种答案来做决策。

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:01.660
So far, with our if blocks, we've been asking a question,
到目前为止，使用“如果那么”积木时，我们一直在问一个问题，

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.500
is the answer to this question yes?
这个问题的答案是“是”吗？

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.360
Is it true?
是真的吗？

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:07.240
And if so, then we're going to run some code.
如果是，那么我们就会运行一些代码。

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.560
There's one block of code that we're running,
如果问题的答案是“是”，我们就会运行一段代码。

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:12.880
if it's the case that the answer to the question is yes.
如果问题的答案是“是”，我们就会运行一段代码。

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.100
But sometimes we want to handle both situations.
但有时候我们想处理两种情况。

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.830
If the answer to a question is yes, we want to do one thing,
如果问题的答案是“是”，我们想做一件事，

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:22.850
and if the answer to a question is no, then we want to do something else.
如果问题的答案是“否”，我们想做另一件事。

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:25.160
And so let's give that a try.
那我们来试试看。

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:29.500
Turns out there's another block that we can use-- not just the if then block,
原来我们还可以使用另一种积木——不只是“如果那么”积木，

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:34.400
but another block under Control called if then else.
还有“控制”分类下的另一种叫做“如果那么否则”的积木。

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:38.260
And the if then else block is structured differently than the other blocks
“如果那么否则”积木的结构和我们目前看到的其他积木不同。

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:39.220
we've seen so far.
和我们目前看到的其他积木不同。

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:43.030
The top part looks very much like the if block we were working with before.
上面部分看起来和我们之前用的“如果”积木很像。

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:47.350
There's a hexagon-shaped space for a question, and then an area beneath it
有一个六边形的区域用来放置问题，然后下面有一个区域

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:51.280
where we could add a stack of blocks for what should happen
我们可以在那里添加一堆积木，来表示应该发生什么。

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.920
if the answer to that question is yes.
如果那个问题的答案是肯定的。

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:57.340
But this block now has another section called else,
但这个积木现在有了另一个部分，叫做“否则”，

00:15:57.340 --> 00:16:01.900
which has what appears to be an area for yet another stack of blocks.
这里看起来像是另一个积木堆的区域。

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:05.560
So inside of this block can be two separate stacks of blocks--
所以这个积木里面可以有两个独立的积木堆——

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:09.820
one stack of blocks that run if the answer to the question is yes,
一个积木堆在问题答案为肯定时运行，

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:14.750
and another stack of blocks that run if the answer to the question is no.
另一个积木堆在问题答案为否定时运行。

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:16.840
So regardless of the answer to the question,
所以不管问题的答案是什么，

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:20.330
we're going to make a decision about which of these two blocks
我们都要决定这两个积木中的哪一个

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.820
we're ultimately going to run.
最终会被运行。

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:25.750
And we can use that now to handle both possibilities-- either the number
现在我们可以用它来处理两种可能性——要么这个数字

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:29.570
is greater than 0 or it's not.
大于 0，要么不是。

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:32.470
And so here I'll take this answer greater than 0 block,
所以在这里我要拿这个“答案大于 0”的积木，

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.610
drag it into this condition.
把它拖到这个条件里。

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:36.730
And in that case, we're going to say positive.
在那种情况下，我们要说“正数”。

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:39.580
I'll get rid of this if statement, because I no longer need it.
我要把这个“如果”语句删掉，因为我不再需要它了。

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:42.550
Now I'm going to replace it with this if else.
现在我要用这个“如果……否则”来替换它。

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:46.870
If the answer is greater than 0, we're going to say positive for two seconds.
如果答案大于 0，我们要说“正数”两秒钟。

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.840
Otherwise-- let's go into Looks--
否则——我们来看看“外观”模块——

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:55.630
let's say negative for two seconds.
我们说“负数”两秒钟。

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:59.370
So now we're making a decision-- running some block of code either time,
所以现在我们在做一个决定——每次都运行一些代码块，

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:03.030
but making a decision about which block of code we would like to run.
但要决定我们想要运行哪一个代码块。

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:04.290
I'll start the program.
我要启动程序。

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.609
It's asking me for a number.
它在问我要一个数字。

00:17:05.609 --> 00:17:08.550
I'll type in a positive number, like the number 2.
我要输入一个正数，比如数字 2。

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.980
And the duck says positive.
鸭子说“正数”。

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.170
We'll try it again.
我们再试一次。

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.170
Asking me for a number--
问我要一个数字——

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.300
I'll type in a negative number-- negative 2.
我要输入一个负数——负 2。

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.260
And the duck says negative.
鸭子说“负数”。

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:20.290
So if the answer to the question is yes, we run one block.
所以如果问题的答案是肯定的，我们运行一个积木。

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.829
Otherwise, we run another block.
否则，我们运行另一个积木。

00:17:22.829 --> 00:17:24.780
And now, there's a slight bug in this program.
现在，这个程序有个小毛病。

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:27.089
You might have noticed that it does well for positive numbers
你可能已经注意到，它对正数处理得很好，

00:17:27.089 --> 00:17:29.280
and it does well for negative numbers, but there
对负数处理得也很好，但是有

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:33.240
is one number that's not really positive and it's not really negative,
一个数字既不是真正的正数，也不是真正的负数，

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.710
and that's a 0.
那就是 0。

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:39.210
If I type in 0 in press Return, the duck says negative.
如果我输入 0 并按回车键，鸭子说“负数”。

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:40.180
Now, why is that?
现在，为什么会这样呢？

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:43.230
Well, it's asking, is the answer greater than 0?
嗯，它在问，答案是否大于 0？

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:44.560
Is 0 greater than 0?
0 大于 0 吗？

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.060
Well, no.
嗯，不是的。

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:47.280
0 is not greater than 0.
0 并不大于 0。

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.560
So instead of running the if block, we instead
所以我们不运行 if 积木，而是

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:54.793
run this else block, where we just say negative every time.
运行这个 else 积木，在这里我们每次都说“负数”。

00:17:54.793 --> 00:17:56.460
And that's maybe not quite what we want.
这可能不是我们想要的结果。

00:17:56.460 --> 00:18:00.300
What I probably want is to ask yet another question-- to ask again,
我可能想再问一个问题——再问一遍，

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.580
is the answer less than 0?
答案小于 0 吗？

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.900
If so, then it's negative.
如果是，那么它就是负数。

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:07.050
And otherwise, if it's not more than 0 and it's not less than 0,
否则，如果它不大于 0 也不小于 0，

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:09.750
then it must just be 0.
那么它一定就是 0。

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:15.390
And to do that, I could add yet another condition inside of this stack here.
要做到这一点，我可以在这个积木堆里再添加一个条件。

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:19.210
I can add anything if else inside of another if else.
我可以在一个 if - else 里面再添加另一个 if - else。

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:24.450
And to do that, I'll take another if else, drag it here underneath the else.
要做到这一点，我再拿一个 if - else 积木，把它拖到 else 下面。

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.280
And so now, if the number's not positive,
所以现在，如果这个数不是正数，

00:18:26.280 --> 00:18:29.940
I can ask a second question-- ask yet another question.
我可以问第二个问题——再问一个问题。

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:35.520
Now the question I want to ask is, is my answer--
现在我想问的问题是，我的答案——

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:37.710
the answer's in the Sensing category--
答案在“感知”类别里——

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:40.320
is the answer to less than 0?
答案小于 0 吗？

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:44.460
If the answer is less than 0, then I want to say negative for two seconds,
如果答案小于 0，那么我想说“负数”两秒钟，

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:46.020
but otherwise--
但否则——

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.860
let's go into Looks--
我们来看看“外观”类别——

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:51.810
I'm just going to say 0.
我就说“0”。

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:54.690
So this is starting to get more complex I have blocks inside
所以这开始变得更复杂了，我有一个积木套着

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:56.460
of blocks inside of other blocks.
另一个积木，另一个积木又套着别的积木。

00:18:56.460 --> 00:19:00.010
And the way to read this now is, what happens if the user types in the number
现在解读这个的方式是，如果用户输入数字

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:00.690
0?
0 会怎样呢？

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.970
Well, we start by asking this question here--
嗯，我们先问这里这个问题——

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:05.850
is the answer 0 greater than 0?
答案 0 大于 0 吗？

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:09.900
No, 0 is not greater than 0, so we ignore the if block
不，0 不大于 0，所以我们忽略 if 积木

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:12.150
and we just look to the else section.
然后我们只看 else 部分。

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.710
And now we ask another question.
现在我们问另一个问题。

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:17.070
Is the answer 0 less than 0?
答案 0 小于 0 吗？

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:18.940
Well, no, that's not true either.
嗯，不，这也不成立。

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:21.850
So we don't run this block, and we instead go to the else,
所以我们不运行这个积木，而是转到 else 部分，

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:26.340
and we run this block, which says, say 0 for two seconds.
然后运行这个积木，它说，说“0”两秒钟。

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:29.170
And that's exactly the behavior we want for the duck.
这正是我们希望这只鸭子有的行为。

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:33.310
So we can verify now that it works by pressing the green flag.
所以我们现在可以通过点击绿色旗帜来验证它是否有效。

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:36.450
And if I type in 0, the duck reports that I
如果我输入 0，这只鸭子会报告说我

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:38.490
did, in fact, type in the number 0.
实际上输入的是数字 0。

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:42.880
If I instead typed a positive number, the duck's is going to say positive.
如果我输入的是一个正数，这只鸭子会说“正数”。

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:45.870
And if I type the negative number, well, then the duck
如果我输入负数，那么这只鸭子

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:48.730
is going to say negative instead.
就会说“负数”。

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:51.960
And so using that, I have the ability to ask multiple questions
利用这个功能，我就能问多个问题

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:56.050
and make decisions based on the answers to those questions.
并根据这些问题的答案来做决策。

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:59.610
So let's use this ability now to build some interesting games that
现在让我们利用这个能力来制作一些有趣的游戏，这些游戏

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:02.870
use our ability to ask questions and make decisions.
会用到我们提问和做决策的能力。

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:05.100
And for that, I'll bring back one of our animals.
为此，我要请回我们的一个动物角色。

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:09.180
We'll go to Animals, and let's bring back the hedgehog.
我们到“动物”分类里，把刺猬请回来。

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:12.840
And what I'd like for the hedgehog to do is to race across the stage--
我希望刺猬做的是在舞台上赛跑——

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:15.300
start at one point in the stage, try and get all the way
从舞台的一个点出发，试着一路

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:19.480
to the right edge of the stage, and see how quickly we can do that.
跑到舞台的右边边缘，看看我们能多快完成。

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.120
So how would I go about creating this game?
那么我该如何制作这个游戏呢？

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:25.410
Well, when the green flag is clicked, when I start the program,
嗯，当绿色旗帜被点击，也就是我启动程序时，

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:30.180
I would like the hedgehog to move to the left side of the stage
我希望刺猬移动到舞台的左边

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:33.790
as a place to begin this particular race.
作为这场特定赛跑的起点。

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.860
So we'll have it go to a particular location.
所以我们让它移动到一个特定的位置。

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:37.860
And this is about right.
差不多就是这里。

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:41.097
Maybe I'll say negative 150 and negative 25 for y.
也许我会把 x 设为 -150，y 设为 -25。

00:20:41.097 --> 00:20:43.930
And I could play around with that to figure out exactly what I want,
我可以多试试，找出我确切想要的位置，

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:47.250
but I'm just choosing nice looking numbers for now.
但现在我只是选了看起来合适的数字。

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.050
And then every time--
然后每次——

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:52.150
not the Space key, but maybe the right key is pressed,
不是按空格键，而是按右键时，

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:55.050
I would like for the hedgehog to move a little bit closer
我希望刺猬向舞台边缘靠近一点。

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:57.600
towards the edge of the stage.
朝着舞台边缘。

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:02.560
So I could have the hedgehog move 10 steps, for example.
比如，我可以让刺猬移动 10 步。

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.340
And what I would like for the hedgehog to do
我希望刺猬做的是

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:08.757
is, once it reaches the edge of the stage,
一旦它到达舞台边缘，

00:21:08.757 --> 00:21:10.840
it should report back to me, how long did it take?
它应该向我反馈，用了多长时间？

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:12.990
How many seconds did it take for the hedgehog
刺猬从舞台的一边跑到另一边用了多少秒？

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:16.630
to get from one side of the stage to the other?
为此，我可以问一个问题。

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.740
And so for that, I can ask a question.
所以为了做到这一点，我可以提一个问题。

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:20.910
We'll go into Control.
我们到“控制”分类里。

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:24.480
I'll drag an if block out, and the question I want to ask--
我拖出一个“如果”积木，我想问的问题——

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:26.400
which will be located under Sensing--
它在“侦测”分类下——

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:29.550
is not whether the hedgehog is touching the mouse pointer,
不是刺猬是否碰到鼠标指针，

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.740
but if the hedgehog is touching the edge--
而是刺猬是否碰到边缘——

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.382
meaning the edge of the stage.
也就是舞台的边缘。

00:21:33.382 --> 00:21:36.090
And if the hedgehog is touching the edge of the stage, what would
如果刺猬碰到了舞台边缘，我希望

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:38.010
I like for the hedgehog to do?
刺猬做什么呢？

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:40.650
Well, I want the hedgehog to say something.
嗯，我希望刺猬说些话。

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.630
And what do I wanted to say?
我想说什么来着？

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:47.070
Well, I want the hedgehog to say whatever this timer value is.
嗯，我想让刺猬说出这个计时器的值。

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.200
Remember, the timer is a value that keeps
记住，计时器是一个会持续

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:53.880
track of how many seconds have passed since the beginning of my program.
记录自程序开始以来过去了多少秒的数值。

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:56.700
And I could have it say just the timer, but I'm actually
我可以让它直接说出计时器的值，但实际上

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:58.200
going to use an operator first.
我要先使用一个运算积木。

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:04.200
I'm going to have us first round the timer, and then say that result. Why
我打算先对计时器的值进行取整，然后说出取整后的结果。为什么

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:04.950
am I doing that?
要这么做呢？

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:07.575
Well, the timer normally has something after the decimal point.
嗯，计时器的值通常小数点后面还有数。

00:22:07.575 --> 00:22:10.148
Maybe like 5.28 seconds have passed or something like that,
比如可能已经过去了5.28秒之类的，

00:22:10.148 --> 00:22:12.690
and I don't really care about what's after the decimal point.
而我其实并不在意小数点后面的数。

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:16.090
I just want to know, has it been five seconds, or six, or seven seconds,
我只想知道，是过去了五秒，还是六秒，或者七秒，

00:22:16.090 --> 00:22:17.440
for example?
举个例子？

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:21.460
So now we're going to move the hedgehog every time I press the right arrow key,
所以现在，每次我按下右箭头键，我们就让刺猬移动，

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:23.430
and if we're touching the edge, we're going
如果它碰到了边缘，我们就

00:22:23.430 --> 00:22:27.850
to say whatever the value of the timer is for two seconds.
说出计时器的值，持续两秒。

00:22:27.850 --> 00:22:30.430
So let's give that a try.
那我们来试试看。

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:32.190
We'll start the program, and every time I
我们启动程序，每次我

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:35.460
press the right arrow, the hedgehog moves a little bit.
按下右箭头，刺猬就会移动一点。

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:41.080
And when it reaches the edge, it's going to report how many seconds it took.
当它到达边缘时，就会报告用了多少秒。

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:44.050
In this case, it took nine seconds for the hedgehog
在这个例子中，刺猬用了九秒

00:22:44.050 --> 00:22:47.980
to get all the way to the rightmost edge of the stage.
才一直移动到舞台的最右边。

00:22:47.980 --> 00:22:51.478
But we can keep asking more questions here, adding more blocks to the program
但我们还可以在这里提出更多问题，往程序里添加更多积木

00:22:51.478 --> 00:22:53.020
to make it a little more interesting.
让它更有趣一点。

00:22:53.020 --> 00:22:57.850
I'll get rid of this, say, for now, and instead replace it with an if else--
我先把这个去掉，比如说，现在，用一个“如果……否则……”积木来代替它——

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:00.610
an opportunity to ask another question.
这是一个提出另一个问题的机会。

00:23:00.610 --> 00:23:03.880
And this time the question I want to ask is this.
这次我想问的问题是这样的。

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:09.140
Under Operators, I'm going to take the less than block out, and I want to ask,
在运算积木里，我要拿出“小于”积木，我想问，

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:13.170
is the timer less than five?
计时器的值小于五吗？

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:15.870
Remember, this question is only ask one time at the edge.
记住，这个问题只会在边缘处问一次。

00:23:15.870 --> 00:23:19.480
Once the hedgehog has reached the edge of the stage, we're going to ask,
一旦刺猬到达了舞台边缘，我们就会问，

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:21.840
has it been fewer than five seconds?
过去了不到五秒吗？

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:25.860
And if so, that was pretty fast, so let's go ahead and have the hedgehog
如果是，那就相当快了，所以我们就让刺猬

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:30.210
say fast for two seconds.
说“快”，持续两秒。

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:35.587
And otherwise, if the timer was not less than five, then
否则，如果计时器的值不小于五，那么

00:23:35.587 --> 00:23:37.920
we were going kind of slowly, so we'll have the hedgehog
我们移动得有点慢，所以我们就让刺猬

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:41.040
say slow for two seconds instead.
说“慢”，持续两秒。

00:23:41.040 --> 00:23:43.760
So now, if I press the green flag and move quickly--
所以现在，如果我按下绿色旗帜然后快速移动——

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:47.000
very quickly try and move the hedgehog across the stage,
非常快速地试着让刺猬穿过舞台，

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:48.500
well, then the hedgehog says fast.
嗯，那么刺猬就会说“快”。

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:51.600
I managed to make it across in fewer than five seconds.
我成功在不到五秒的时间内通过了。

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:53.030
But if I'm going more slowly--
但如果我移动得更慢些——

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:59.520
I'll try it again, and more slowly press the right arrow key.
我再试一次，更慢地按右箭头键。

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.840
Well, then it's going to take a little bit longer, and at the end,
嗯，那花费的时间会稍微长一点，最后，

00:24:03.840 --> 00:24:06.600
the hedgehog does report that I was slow, that I was not
刺猬会提示我速度慢，说我

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.760
very fast at moving across.
通过得不快。

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:10.470
So that's one possible game you could try
所以这是你可以尝试制作的一种游戏，

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:13.380
to build by asking questions-- questions about whether we're touching
通过提出问题来实现——比如关于是否碰到边缘的问题，

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:17.730
the edge, questions about whether the timer is a particular value-- less
关于计时器是否达到某个特定值的问题——例如，

00:24:17.730 --> 00:24:19.870
than a particular value, for example.
是否小于某个特定值。

00:24:19.870 --> 00:24:23.850
And let's try one more example of a game we could build with the hedgehog.
我们再来看一个可以用刺猬制作的游戏示例。

00:24:23.850 --> 00:24:26.460
Go ahead and get rid of these blocks for now.
现在先把这些积木块删掉。

00:24:26.460 --> 00:24:29.790
Let's try and build a maze for the hedgehog to try and navigate around,
我们试着为刺猬建一个迷宫，让它在里面探索，

00:24:29.790 --> 00:24:33.550
where you're not supposed to hit any of the walls of the maze, for example.
比如，在这个过程中你不能碰到迷宫的任何墙壁。

00:24:33.550 --> 00:24:36.120
And I could do that by changing the backdrop.
我可以通过更改背景来实现这一点。

00:24:36.120 --> 00:24:39.360
Let's use the backdrop to build a maze for our hedgehog.
我们用背景为刺猬建一个迷宫。

00:24:39.360 --> 00:24:44.430
I want the walls to be red maybe, and I'll
我可能想让墙壁是红色的，然后我

00:24:44.430 --> 00:24:46.650
go ahead and click on this line tool that's going
点击这个线条工具，

00:24:46.650 --> 00:24:50.640
to let me draw lines on the stage.
这样我就能在舞台上画线条了。

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:54.430
Oh, and I should really be changing the outline to make the outline red.
哦，我真的应该把轮廓颜色改成红色。

00:24:54.430 --> 00:24:57.880
So let me delete this line for now, and try it again.
所以我先把这条线删掉，再试一次。

00:24:57.880 --> 00:25:00.970
I want the outline of this to be red.
我想让这个的轮廓是红色的。

00:25:00.970 --> 00:25:03.430
That's going to give me some red lines.
这样就能得到一些红色的线条。

00:25:03.430 --> 00:25:11.650
And I'll go ahead and just try and build a little maze for our hedgehog
我接着试着为刺猬建一个小迷宫，

00:25:11.650 --> 00:25:15.210
to try to navigate around.
让它在里面探索。

00:25:15.210 --> 00:25:17.370
And that looks all right.
看起来还不错。

00:25:17.370 --> 00:25:19.620
I'll go back to the code.
我回到代码区。

00:25:19.620 --> 00:25:20.597
Here's our hedgehog.
这是我们的刺猬。

00:25:20.597 --> 00:25:22.680
It's a bit big for this maze right now, so I might
现在它对于这个迷宫来说有点大了，所以我可能

00:25:22.680 --> 00:25:24.222
want to make it a little bit smaller.
想把它变小一点。

00:25:24.222 --> 00:25:27.660
I can go in the Size here, change the size to-- let's try 40.
我可以在这里调整大小，把大小改成——试试40吧。

00:25:27.660 --> 00:25:30.150
Yeah, that's probably a good size for our hedgehog.
嗯，这个大小对我们的刺猬来说可能正合适。

00:25:30.150 --> 00:25:32.290
And now, how do I want this maze to work?
现在，我想让这个迷宫怎么运作呢？

00:25:32.290 --> 00:25:34.980
Well, I'll have it move via the arrow keys.
嗯，我让它通过箭头键来移动。

00:25:34.980 --> 00:25:37.950
So whenever the right arrow key is pressed,
所以每当按下右箭头键时，

00:25:37.950 --> 00:25:42.840
our hedgehog is going to change its x position by, let's say, five.
我们的刺猬的x坐标会增加，比如说，增加5。

00:25:42.840 --> 00:25:44.730
10 is maybe a lot for this.
增加10可能有点多了。

00:25:44.730 --> 00:25:47.340
So it's going to move five spaces to the right.
所以它会向右移动五格。

00:25:47.340 --> 00:25:48.600
And what do I want to do?
我接下来要做什么呢？

00:25:48.600 --> 00:25:51.750
I want to check now, is the hedgehog touching a wall?
我现在想检查一下，刺猬是否碰到墙壁了？

00:25:51.750 --> 00:25:55.240
Because if it ends up touching a wall, that's no good.
因为如果它最后碰到了墙，那就不妙了。

00:25:55.240 --> 00:26:02.190
So I'll ask, if the hedgehog is touching a color--
所以我要判断，如果刺猬碰到了某种颜色——

00:26:02.190 --> 00:26:04.230
because the walls are all red.
因为墙都是红色的。

00:26:04.230 --> 00:26:06.330
So I'll grab a color using this eyedropper tool,
所以我要用这个取色工具选取一种颜色，

00:26:06.330 --> 00:26:08.100
grabbing it from the stage.
从舞台上取色。

00:26:08.100 --> 00:26:11.280
Let's grab this red right here.
咱们就取这里的红色。

00:26:11.280 --> 00:26:14.330
So if the hedgehog is touching the color red,
所以如果刺猬碰到了红色，

00:26:14.330 --> 00:26:18.170
well, then I want the hedgehog to just, for now, let's say, go
那么目前，我希望刺猬，比如说，移动到

00:26:18.170 --> 00:26:19.760
to a random position on the stage.
舞台上的一个随机位置。

00:26:19.760 --> 00:26:23.690
It's going to somehow magically disappear and reappear somewhere else.
它会神奇地消失，然后在别的地方重新出现。

00:26:23.690 --> 00:26:26.720
We'll have it go to a random position.
我们让它移动到一个随机位置。

00:26:26.720 --> 00:26:29.000
And that's what happens when I press the right arrow.
这就是我按下右箭头时会发生的情况。

00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:32.330
I'm going to duplicate this whole thing by Control clicking and pressing
我要通过按住Ctrl键点击并按下

00:26:32.330 --> 00:26:36.800
Duplicate, and do the same thing for the left arrow.
“复制”来复制这一整段代码，然后对左箭头做同样的操作。

00:26:36.800 --> 00:26:40.610
But this time, we're going to change x by negative five.
但这次，我们要将x坐标减去5。

00:26:40.610 --> 00:26:45.020
And I also want the up and down arrows to work too, so I'll duplicate once.
我也希望上下箭头能起作用，所以我再复制一次。

00:26:45.020 --> 00:26:47.060
Let's do this for the up arrow.
咱们来为上箭头设置一下。

00:26:47.060 --> 00:26:51.800
When the up arrow happens, I want to not change the x value by something,
当按下上箭头时，我不想改变x坐标的值，

00:26:51.800 --> 00:26:57.630
but change the y value by negative five.
而是要将y坐标减去5。

00:26:57.630 --> 00:27:01.350
And one more arrow key-- let's duplicate this one more time and use the same
还有一个方向键——咱们再复制一次，用同样的

00:27:01.350 --> 00:27:04.300
code for the down arrow--
代码来控制下箭头——

00:27:04.300 --> 00:27:07.508
this time, changing the y by--
这次，改变y坐标的值为——

00:27:07.508 --> 00:27:09.300
actually, here, it should be negative five,
实际上，这里应该是减去5，

00:27:09.300 --> 00:27:11.700
and for up, it should be five-- because when we're going up the,
而向上移动时，应该是加上5——因为当我们向上移动时，

00:27:11.700 --> 00:27:14.820
y value's increasing, when we're going down, the y value's decreasing.
y坐标值会增加，向下移动时，y坐标值会减少。

00:27:14.820 --> 00:27:17.430
And I could test that out by pressing the up arrow,
我可以通过按下上箭头来测试一下，

00:27:17.430 --> 00:27:18.930
and the hedgehog moves up.
刺猬就会向上移动。

00:27:18.930 --> 00:27:20.440
I press the down arrow--
我按下下箭头——

00:27:20.440 --> 00:27:21.552
the hedgehog moves down.
刺猬就会向下移动。

00:27:21.552 --> 00:27:23.010
I press left-- it goes to the left.
我按下左箭头——它会向左移动。

00:27:23.010 --> 00:27:24.552
I press right-- it goes to the right.
我按下右箭头——它会向右移动。

00:27:24.552 --> 00:27:29.030
But if ever I hit-- watch what happens if I hit a red wall.
但要是我撞到了——看看我撞到红色的墙会发生什么。

00:27:29.030 --> 00:27:32.250
The hedgehog magically vanishes from where it was,
刺猬会神奇地从它原来的位置消失，

00:27:32.250 --> 00:27:33.600
and it reappears somewhere else.
然后在别的地方重新出现。

00:27:33.600 --> 00:27:36.740
And you could decide on your own what happens when the hedgehog hits a wall.
你可以自己决定刺猬撞到墙时会发生什么。

00:27:36.740 --> 00:27:37.990
Maybe it plays a sound effect.
也许它会播放一个音效。

00:27:37.990 --> 00:27:39.978
Maybe it does something else.
也许它会做其他事情。

00:27:39.978 --> 00:27:42.020
But you could make this game however you like it.
但你可以按照自己的喜好来制作这个游戏。

00:27:42.020 --> 00:27:44.812
And here I just have a hedgehog that can navigate through the maze,
在这里，我有一只可以在迷宫中穿梭的刺猬，

00:27:44.812 --> 00:27:49.000
and whenever it hits a wall, it reappears somewhere else.
而且每当它撞到墙时，就会在别的地方重新出现。

00:27:49.000 --> 00:27:51.500
And so these conditions give you a lot of power, the ability
所以这些条件赋予了你很大的能力，即

00:27:51.500 --> 00:27:55.160
to ask questions and make decisions inside of your programs
在你的程序里提出问题并根据问题的答案做出决策的能力。

00:27:55.160 --> 00:27:57.530
based on the answers to those questions.
基于这些问题的答案。

00:27:57.530 --> 00:28:00.430
That's it for today for an introduction to programming with Scratch.
今天关于用Scratch编程的介绍就到这里。

00:28:00.430 --> 00:28:02.180
Next time, we'll pick up where we left off
下次，我们将接着上次停下的地方继续。

00:28:02.180 --> 00:28:05.480
and see what else we can do in the world of putting together these Scratch
看看在组合这些Scratch

00:28:05.480 --> 00:28:06.080
blocks.
积木的世界里我们还能做些什么。

00:28:06.080 --> 00:28:07.990
We'll see you then.
到时候再见。
